ve_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/15198","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/15198","diff_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/15198.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/15198.patch","merged_at":"2022-02-01T11:15:56Z"},"body":"ticket-30360\r\n\r\n@carltongibson said we should use the approach of having a second setting called `SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS` in #13850.\r\n\r\nI made an opinionated approach on supplying a new parameter, `read_keys` to `Signer`. It makes sense to me to identify the keys that can only be used for validation (perhaps I should have named it validator_keys). I also kept the same pattern regarding the setters and getters in PasswordResetTokenGenerator.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/15198/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/15198/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13850","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13850/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13850/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13850/events","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/13850","id":780642949,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTUwNTA0NDU1","number":13850,"title":"Fixed #30360 -- Support rotation of secret keys.","user":{"login":"carltongibson","id":64686,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0Njg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64686?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson","html_url":"https://github.com/carltongibson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carltongibson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":19,"created_at":"2021-01-06T15:38:25Z","updated_at":"2021-12-14T15:15:04Z","closed_at":"2021-12-14T15:15:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/13850","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/13850","diff_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/13850.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/13850.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Take 2 on #13618. \r\n\r\n@apollo13 New PR, as per your suggestion. This one passes the tests at least. It's has edges, but if you could give it your thoughts, that would be amazing. \r\n\r\nAs per your thoughts: Normalise in `Settings.__init__()` and raise if empty in `LazySettings.__getattr__()`. \r\n\r\nI needed to normalise in `override_settings.__init__()`, because `enable()` was too hard™. \r\nWhat are you thoughts here? Does it look OK? \r\n\r\nHad to add a `secret` property in PasswordTokenGenerator to handle lazy reading the secret value from SECRET_KEYS. \r\n\r\nDo you think it's viable. Happy to work it if so. \r\nClearly it needs docs. \r\nWhat test do you want to see? \r\n\r\nThanks! 🚀 \r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13850/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}